	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Just a few days before Operation Bellflower commences, I receive word that the renovations in my room are completed.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Will you be returning to your room, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, that's the plan.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Even knowing that I'm about to leave, Mutsumi-san acts the same as always.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Personally, I would not mind if you were to stay a while longer.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ahaha, you know I couldn't do that.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Well perhaps... you are correct, but...”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"In the end, Mutsumi-san never once gives voice to her sentiments.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"There is no guarantee that I will come back alive from Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"But given that she's declined to say anything, she must mean to take any romantic feelings she has to the grave.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Shall I accompany you to your shop?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san speaks less and less the closer we get to the shop, and by the time we arrive at the entrance, she's fallen completely silent.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, thanks for everything. I will certainly return the favor someday.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Please, there is no need for that.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Your assistance at the restaurant was more than enough.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't be satisfied with just that.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Well, if you so insist, might I ask for just one thing?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san approaches me, laying a delicate hand on my chest.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Nnm...”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"It happens faster than I can register.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Before I can even process Mutsumi-san's face approaching mine, a fleeting softness brushes against my lips for the briefest of moments.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Our faces still close enough to reach out and touch, we stare silently into each other's eyes for several moments.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"It's as though time itself has stopped.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Mutsumi-san?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Slowly, she separates her body from mine.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“My apologies. Please forget about that.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I came here fully intending to see you off without saying anything.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Should I take this to mean what I think it does?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Still staring into my eyes, Mutsumi-san shows me the tinest of nods.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I am a female warrior. I know full well that my harboring romantic sentiments will never amount to anything.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“As I said a moment ago, please forget about everything.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“This was nothing more than a momentary caprice.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Until we meet again, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I bid you good fortune with Operation Bellflower.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san bows to cut off my response and turns to walk away without looking back.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haah...”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"I heave a deep sigh which stirs up an immense sense of powerlessness inside my chest.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"The sensation of Mutsumi-san's lips still lingers on mine.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"This must be her way of putting her feelings to bed.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"A sharp voice echoes out from inside the shop.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I'm home.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry to spring this on you, but can you watch over the shop? I've got an errand to run!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm? Oh, sure.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Later!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Akari dashes out from the shop.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"My heart throbs in my chest like never before.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Unlike the elation from standing upon the battlefield, the pounding of my heart is accompanied only by pain.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Unable to endure it, I curl up on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"As his name escapes my lips, my chest feels even tighter.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"How am I possibly meant to quit him with nothing but a kiss?",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"I want him to love me.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I want him to hold me so tight that my body creaks.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"But that is why I did not say anything to him at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I was terrified that I would be unable to hold myself back.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"With the knowledge that Soujin-sama's heart does not belong to me, I mustn't force my feelings upon him.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I will treasure the warmth of his lips in my heart, and as befitting a female warrior, devote all of myself to my blade.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“(During Operation Bellflower, I will distinguish myself on the battlefield as a worthy head of House Sarashina... Soujin-sama.)”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"I have yet to tell anyone about my intentions to participate in Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"In truth, I had made up my mind the day Shiranui recognized Hotori-sama.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"However, no warrior can step upon the battlefield without first making their peace with death.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Hence I wanted to put my feelings for Soujin-sama to rest, once and for all.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"So that my weak-hearted sentiments do not lead my blade astray.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"And yet, I cannot help but continue to yearn for\nSoujin-sama's love.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Suddenly, the front door of the restaurant flies open.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, I'm coming in.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“M-My, Akari-sama. What brings you here?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Akari-sama bursts into the restaurant, striding toward me with purpose.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Huh? Umm?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, are you really okay with this?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm talking about Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Akari-sama's words cause my breath to catch in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"She must have witnessed what happened in front of the flower shop.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Those feelings of yours are much more powerful than you give them credit for.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You might think you've made up your mind. You might think you can just give it up. But you'll never be able to repress your love for someone.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee. It is as though you are speaking from experience.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I am. That's how I know.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, if you leave things like this, you'll regret it for sure.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You should tell him everything you've been holding back.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Akari-sama's round eyes stare straight into me.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Despite being of such tender years, her overpowering presence leaves me at a loss for words.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin'll come by later to pick this up. That'll be your last chance.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's no guarantee you'll see each other again once Operation Bellflower commences.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Akari-sama places an item on the table beside her and turns to leave without another word.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“(What's this?)”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"The object she left behind is a small key.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Could this be the key to Soujin-sama's room?",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"As soon as Akari gets back, she orders me to head to Miyoshi to retrieve a lost item.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Apparently it's the new key to my room, which she conveniently happened to leave behind at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"She's clearly decided to take the matter between me and Mutsumi-san into her own hands.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"I want to get mad at her, but there's nothing I can do without my key.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"And so, I do as I'm told and find myself here in front of Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san is occupied with wiping down the tables.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"When she notices me, she stops moving and greets me with a smile.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ah, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm here to pick up a lost item.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Yes, I've been expecting you.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san hands me a small paper parcel.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"From the feel of it, I can tell that my key is inside.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry about that.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I guess I'll be going.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"I turn to leave before I end up saying anything I shouldn't.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Her desperate scream stops me right in my tracks.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"As I whirl around, the sight of her forlorn expression sends a twinge through my chest.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Is she crying?",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I-I'm sorry. I didn't mean to raise my voice.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san looks down, dabbing her eyes with a handkerchief.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Over and over, she wipes her eyes with her bellflower-colored handkerchief.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"All the while, refusing to meet my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It is just as Akari-sama said...”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I could never hope to suppress these feelings forever.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's this about Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san turns my question aside with a soft smile.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I'll not hide it any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Would you hear me out, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Taking a few deep breaths to steady herself, Mutsumi-san takes a seat at the counter.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I move to sit next to her.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Phew. To think I'd shed tears twice in the span of a single day.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is the first time I've ever seen you cry.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“What a shameful display for the head of House Sarashina.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“At this rate, even my most meritorious service in Operation Bellflower will amount to nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san's words give me a start.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you mean to say you'll be lending us your strength?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Yes. As meager as my abilities are, they are at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Her words are reserved, but her expression is resolute.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Hers is the face of a warrior prepared to meet her death.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehee, I see that you are not particularly shocked.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I'm just not showing it. I'm plenty shocked.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Suddenly, I understand everything.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san has been involving herself with me so much lately because she's resolved herself to participate in Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"She must have intended that kiss at the flower shop as her final farewell.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I fear not losing my life upon the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“However, there is one regret that will forever haunt me.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san's eyes slowly fill with passion.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"The sensation of her earlier kiss once again crosses my lips.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, you understand what I speak of, do you not?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“At this point, how could I possibly content myself with nothing more than a...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"She slowly trails off, fixing me with a fragile, delicate gaze.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Lacking all her usual composure, her tearful eyes peer into mine with the light of a helplessly lovelorn maiden.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why do you feel so strongly for me?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If it's because I've forgotten, I can only apologize.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You have nothing to apologize for.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“My feelings have always remained unrequited.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Would you tell me about them?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"As though peering into the past, Mutsumi-san begins to recount her memories.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“This was around one year prior to the Republic's invasion.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“At the time, I encountered a seemingly insurmountable wall on account of my bloodline and gender.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Not only was I unable to improve my bladesmanship, I was failing to execute the forms I thought I had already mastered.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“That was when a certain person happened to approach me.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Was that─”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed, it was you, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“This is what you told me.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“'The blade is nothing more than a means for fighting. What truly matters is the resolve to continue your fight even should your blade be shattered.'”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“As the successor to House Sarashina, I was unable at the time to think of anything but honing my bladesmanship.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“To the extent that I lost sight of the fact that what truly matters to a warrior lies elsewhere.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did I really say all that?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You did. And your words were what saved me.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If I could not succeed with the blade, I could reach for the spear. If that comes to nothing, I still had the bow. Even if all else failed, I could still rely on hand-to-hand combat.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“That thought lifted a great weight off my shoulders.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“My blade arts master immediately remarked that I was like a person reborn.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I believe that were it not for you, I never would have survived the war and succeeded to the headship of House Sarashina.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Naturally, I still don't remember it, but if my past self was able to save Mutsumi-san, that makes me very happy indeed.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“That is why ever since... my feelings towards you have been...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san shows me a bashful smile.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Like a beautiful wildflower spreading its petals, the sight of it sets my heart at ease.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“After speaking to you time and again, I thought to convey my gratitude by preparing meals for you.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You were always exceptionally fond of the tofu that I made for you...”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I believe that is when you began to declare tofu as your favorite food.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So your cooking was the reason I fell in love with tofu.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed. Hence I hoped that eating my tofu might have helped to bring your memories back, but...”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"The day I brought her lunchbox to school, Mutsumi-san asked if I had any remarks on anything besides the taste.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"She must have been hoping that my memories would've returned.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I know full well that a female warrior has no value besides her role on the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“However...”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ever since I learned about Operation Bellflower, I have been unable to contain my feelings.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If I am to go to my death, I wished to at least experience once the joys of an ordinary woman.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san has laid bare all her feelings, and in doing so, showed me many expressions she would normally never allow me to see.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"And now, she desires more than a mere kiss.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Of course, I'm very fond of Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"But I cannot say that I truly have romantic feelings for her.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Still, if this is what Mutsumi-san desires, I would like to answer her feelings.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"That is all I am able to do.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san peers intently into my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I dare not go as far as to ask for your heart.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I simply beg that you might indulge my selfishness a while longer.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san whispers as she lays a hand across my lap.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Her hand, always so unwavering upon the hilt of her blade, trembles ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"The tender affection welling up within my chest prevents me from brushing her fingers aside.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san's eyes go wide at my acquiescence.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"For a while, she simply stares at me.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. I know that you are simply...”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please, you don't need to say anything more.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"I clasp Mutsumi-san's trembling hand in mine.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just stay right there.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“...Nmm, nmh...”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"I seal our lips with a kiss.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"As our lips part, Mutsumi-san's eyes well up with tears.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm done with always letting you catch me off guard.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just once, I wanted to be the one giving you a shock.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Well, consider me shocked.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Looks like it was a success.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Though she'd been looking up at me all this time, she suddenly turns her head down.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"And proceeds to bury her face in my chest.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“The head of House Sarashina mustn't allow so many of her tears be seen by others.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Was it really enough of a shock to cry over?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Of course not. These are tears of joy.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Gosh, you surely understood that much, didn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san whispers into my chest, and I respond by wrapping her in my embrace.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, could it be that you're weak to direct approaches?”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“How could I possibly not be?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Everyone calls you an unattainable flower, so I thought\nyou'd be used to it by now.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I'm not used to it at all. All I know is how to turn them down.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Besides, nobody has ever acted this boldly towards me before.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm about to be even bolder.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san stiffens up nervously in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But are you okay with it being me?”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't remember anything about my past.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How can I put this...”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Basically, I'm probably not the same Tokita Soujin that you fell in love with.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“For me, you will always be that Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“And I want him─you─to make love to me.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san looks up at me with searching eyes.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"We stare into each other for several seconds before she eventually lays her lips on mine.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hahh, fwah, aah...!”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"I lean deeper into our kiss, as though trying to meld our lips together.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"When I finally separate our lips, Mutsumi-san lets out a regretful sigh, as though hoping for more.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"With half-lidded eyes and parted lips, she fixes me with an amorous gaze.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"I reply with a simple nod, and we both wordlessly make for the tatami room.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"With her breathing calm, Mutsumi stares at me intently.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I can die now without any regrets.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Truly, you have my deepest gratitude, Soujin-sama... nnmh...”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Still stroking my head, Mutsumi-san brushes my lips with a light kiss.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Neither of our fates is sealed just yet.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's both live and see our Empire reclaimed.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I suppose you are right... If I live, I will be able to see you once again.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Even so, I am perfectly contented already.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“For as long as I live, I will never harbor sentiments for anyone again.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You plan to continue on being an unattainable flower?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Is the sight of such a flower withering to ashes not most beautiful indeed?”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehee, assuming that I am not first scattered to the winds during Operation Bellflower.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't ever want to see you die.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Having the man I love most say that to me... just might make me the most fortunate woman in the world.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“This will be the very last time... nnmh...”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san graces me with one final kiss before separating from me.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"That day, Miyoshi opens a few hours later than usual.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"I'm sitting in my regular spot at the counter with Akari beside me.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"Akari whispers, poking me on the shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"She checks her surroundings before continuing in a low voice.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know you and Mutsumi-san had a lot going on, but you worked everything out, right?”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san, meanwhile, is watching over the crowd of boisterous warriors with a serene expression.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, it's all worked out.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How'd you manage that?”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Eh, don't sweat the details.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san and I are the same as ever. Nothing more than proprietess and patron.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right...”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"I turn to look at Mutsumi-san once again, and this time, our eyes meet.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"As though coming to a sudden realization, she makes her way over to us.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, you were still intending to practice your cookery, were you not?”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I happen to have some time to spare, so it would be my pleasure to teach you right now.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“We don't know when I might be able to teach you again, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san hasn't told anyone else about her intentions to participate in Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"No one else besides me would interpret her words to be implicative of her resolve to die.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll pass for now.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But in exchange, promise me you'll teach me some other time.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san raises a hand to her mouth, twisted into a troubled smile.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, if you insist...”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Very well. You have my word.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Let us come together to cook here once again.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Having overheard our puzzling exchange, Akari looks curiously between me and Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"Thinking thoughts of our brighter future, I return to my meal.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"─Mutsumi-san's cooking will surely taste delicious beyond compare in a free and peaceful Empire.",
			},
